OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will stay
OL,6,Fdry through the evening and overnight
OL,7,Fwith increasing clear spells
OL,8,Fdeveloping, which will allow areas of
OL,9,Ffrost and fog to form. Light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FA chilly start with any fog
OL,12,Fslow to clear. Otherwise dry with
OL,13,Fvariable cloud interspersed with
OL,14,Fbright and sunny spells. Areas of fog
OL,15,Fdeveloping again in the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
